<title>ISRAEL: Makhteshim, Agan swap planned for May.</title>
<headline>Makhteshim, Agan swap planned for May.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Koor Industries said the share swap of Maktheshim Chemical Works and Agan Chemical Manufacturers will take place next May.</p>
<p>The swap, by which shareholders in the two chemical companies will be offered to exchange their shares for shares in a new holding company, M.A.G.M. Chemistry Holdings, will take place after the shareholders approve the swap.</p>
<p>The method for swapping the shares has yet to be decided and will be based on evaluations made by outside consultants, Koor said.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
